			"notes": "In this version:\n- Update to 1.20\n- Moved Empowerment application to the Anvil (its no longer in the Smithing Table). This is because I did not want to gate Ruined tool Empowering by requiring a template.\n- Fixed bug where Ruined items' names could not be changed in an Anvil\n- Lore applied by Name Tags to Ruined items will now stack instead of override. Now you can apply as much text as you like!\n- Combining a Ruined item with a Name Tag named \"clear\" will remove all the Lore on the item"
		},
