			"notes": "In this release:\n- **Modded equipment is supported!**\n   - A broken modded tool/armor will drop a \"Ruined Item's Ashes\"\n   - This acts like any other Ruined item (can be repaired in the Crafting Grid & Empowered at a Smithing Table)\n   - The Config field \"ruinedItemsAshesRepairItems\" sets which Item should be used to repair the ruined item at an Anvil (e.g. \"copper_mod:copper_sword/minecraft:copper_ingot;\" means the \"copper_mod:copper_sword\" uses the \"minecraft:copper_ingot\" to repair)\n   - There's also a blocklist in case you want to disable specific modded items\n- Fix Mending not repairing Ruined Items"
		},
